# tmpfiles.d entry for asterisk. The service runs unprivileged
# (User=asterisk), so it cannot create its own runtime dir; tmpfiles.d
# owns creation with the service identity at boot. /run is volatile by
# design (pid/control-socket state is restart-scoped, unlike alfred's
# persistent socket which deliberately lives under /var/run).
d /run/asterisk 0755 asterisk asterisk -
